# Hosts a review cell may reach. Anchored regexes, matched against the CONNECT
# target host (FilterExtended On, FilterURLs Off).
#
# EXACTLY ONE ENTRY IS INTENDED. Every addition widens the channel through which
# a reviewing agent could reach the answer key -- the merged upstream PR -- and
# through which repository-controlled content could exfiltrate ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.
# test/crb-egress-config.bats pins the count, so adding a host is a deliberate,
# reviewed act rather than an edit nobody notices.
^api\.anthropic\.com$
